{"id":"georgia/ga-government","title":{"en":"Georgia Government \u0026 Citizenship","zh":"佐治亚州政府与公民"},"url":"https://shanchuan.org/middle/georgia/ga-government.html","clips":[{"key":"0167c4d3","lang":"en","send":"Gordon County.","text":"Gordon County."},{"key":"016fb27b","lang":"en","send":"Clay County.","text":"Clay County."},{"key":"03625ace","lang":"en","send":"Murray County.","text":"Murray County."},{"key":"03db11dc","lang":"en","send":"Fayette County.","text":"Fayette County."},{"key":"03eb9fc6","lang":"en","send":"Chattahoochee County.","text":"Chattahoochee County."},{"key":"0584bb8d","lang":"en","send":"Taliaferro County.","text":"Taliaferro County."},{"key":"05906d20","lang":"en","send":"Rabun County.","text":"Rabun County."},{"key":"05d0c2ec","lang":"en","send":"Lee County.","text":"Lee County."},{"key":"06dbac19","lang":"en","send":"Douglas County.","text":"Douglas County."},{"key":"098f313d","lang":"en","send":"The Governor. Carries out and enforces the laws. Governor: at least 30, a US citizen for 15 years and a Georgia resident for 6 years. A 4-year term, at most two terms in a row. The lieutenant governor has the same qualifications, presides over the Senate and becomes governor if the office is empty. The governor writes the budget proposal, sets the revenue estimate, signs or vetoes bills and can veto single spending items. Other statewide elected officers include the secretary of state, attorney general, state school superintendent and agriculture commissioner. State agencies do the daily work: Department of Education, Department of Transportation (GDOT), Department of Driver Services (your license!), Department of Natural Resources (state parks), Department of Juvenile Justice.","text":"The Governor. Carries out and enforces the laws. Governor: at least 30, a US citizen for 15 years and a Georgia resident for 6 years. A 4-year term, at most two terms in a row. The lieutenant governor has the same qualifications, presides over the Senate and becomes governor if the office is empty. The governor writes the budget proposal, sets the revenue estimate, signs or vetoes bills and can veto single spending items. Other statewide elected officers include the secretary of state, attorney general, state school superintendent and agriculture commissioner. State agencies do the daily work: Department of Education, Department of Transportation (GDOT), Department of Driver Services (your license!), Department of Natural Resources (state parks), Department of Juvenile Justice."},{"key":"0d6b9785","lang":"en","send":"Bacon County.","text":"Bacon County."},{"key":"0e0dd98e","lang":"en","send":"South Carolina.","text":"South Carolina."},{"key":"0e99acc4","lang":"en","send":"Houston County.","text":"Houston County."},{"key":"0f44ff02","lang":"en","send":"Coffee County.","text":"Coffee County."},{"key":"0fdb6edb","lang":"en","send":"Emanuel County.","text":"Emanuel County."},{"key":"10a35eb1","lang":"en","send":"Fulton County. home of Atlanta, the state capital","text":"Fulton County. home of Atlanta, the state capital"},{"key":"11d1c30c","lang":"en","send":"Calhoun County.","text":"Calhoun County."},{"key":"1335cce8","lang":"en","send":"Haralson County.","text":"Haralson County."},{"key":"14f7db7a","lang":"en","send":"Heard County.","text":"Heard County."},{"key":"1545f73d","lang":"en","send":"Newton County.","text":"Newton County."},{"key":"17c203a7","lang":"en","send":"Clarke County. home of Athens — the smallest county by area","text":"Clarke County. home of Athens — the smallest county by area"},{"key":"18c75c78","lang":"en","send":"Long County.","text":"Long County."},{"key":"1bfc3deb","lang":"en","send":"Effingham County.","text":"Effingham County."},{"key":"1eb5fd11","lang":"en","send":"Lincoln County.","text":"Lincoln County."},{"key":"1f9dd518","lang":"en","send":"Wilcox County.","text":"Wilcox County."},{"key":"24dbba64","lang":"en","send":"Wayne County.","text":"Wayne County."},{"key":"2709ddae","lang":"en","send":"C